    "name": "Long COVID - Symptoms Due to COVID-19 - Psychological Risk Factors",
    "code": "PX992004",
    "abbreviation": "PX992004",
    "description": "A self-administered questionnaire to better describe and understand the patient experience and recovery of those with confirmed or suspected COVID-19, with a specific emphasis on Long COVID experience especially with tiredness and appetite.",
